        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">PC6 (Neiguan)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Inner Pass</span></h3>
